TE ROOM (operator, same word):'' cabal realms — resources private to a group of Personas — give the eaten designs their lawful VENUE: a guardian-cabal realm (the subject + their chosen guardians, keyhive-ciphered, named by its own doc id, nothing to enumerate) carries the recovery CONVERSATION and the gathered signatures — compiled BY the parties ABOUT themselves, private, causal: carriage, not registry. The split that keeps it lawful: ''the realm coordinates, the chain hardens'' — safety NEVER moves into the room (a provisional rotation still out-competes on the prefix's own KEL by fencing), and the compartment-collector law reads realm membership too (one guardian realm never spans two compartments of one human). Evidence: the Keel-Reader's 18-row fork→entity matrix + guardian-card census (this session, 2026-09-06).
